//Packjjangpy.npc

*J_NAME		"Peddler Yampi"

*J_CHAT			"Oh, you are amazing to find me in the continent of Priston." 
*J_CHAT			"I usually sell items that are hard to find. Please, find me often because I sometimes sell very good items."
*J_CHAT			"I'm Yampi who sells items only for 5 min. Please, choose one."
*J_CHAT                 "This is the item you want. I'm selling it now. I have to go soon, so please hurry up"

